  playerDialogueText: {fileID: 1706175284}
  dialogue:
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: This grave... Elana and Mr. Jacob.
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: They were the most faithful and loyal servants of the Hayes family.
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: Yeah... even their souls seemed happy to serve the Hayes family, as if
      that was their purpose.
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: "(sighs) Even so... I didn\u2019t want them to be trapped inside that mansion.
      I wanted them to be free from the shackles of this curse."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: Your intention might have reached them. Perhaps they found peace because
      of your will to set them free.
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: (softly) I truly hope so. They deserve to live freely, beyond the grasp
      of this nightmare.
  npcContButton: {fileID: 1209865328}
  playerContButton: {fileID: 418623676}
