--- !u!114 &1129675133
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1129675128}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e1bb02c8da6200b48aeb104391660cbd, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  npcDialoguePanel: {fileID: 746300431}
  npcDialogueText: {fileID: 825070920}
  playerDialoguePanel: {fileID: 1832466389}
  playerDialogueText: {fileID: 2025966724}
  dialogue:
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: Cecilia, there you are!
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: Oh, mister. I thought you already left this place.
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "Well, I was going to, but I didn\u2019t see you when we got out. I was
      worried."
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: "(smiling faintly) This is the first time someone\u2019s worried about
      me. Thank you for that."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "It\u2019s fine. But... whose grave is this?"
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: "This is my family\u2019s grave."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: ...So you already knew everything that happened here?
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: "Yeah. And I\u2019m the one who escaped from the curse of the artifact."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: You mean the cursed item Alice was protecting?
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: Yes. Before, we managed to destroy one artifact, but Alice became... different.
      More aggressive. She started keeping a close eye on me.
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: You mean the people who came before me, right?
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: "Yes. After they destroyed the first item, Alice grew angrier and more
      paranoid. She... became someone I didn\u2019t recognize. I was terrified. I
      had no choice but to take on the role of \u2018milady\u2019 to keep her focus
      on me and avoid further chaos."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: " I\u2019m sorry you had to go through that. But now, you\u2019re free
      from the shackles of the curse."
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: "(pausing) You\u2019re right. I should be happy about that."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "Let\u2019s leave this place for good."
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: "Yeah... let\u2019s go."
